  "intro_html": "<p>In early summer 2019, this approach path to Capanna Sasc-Furä was opened because the old path via Val Bondasca was made inaccessible by the Cengalo landslide.The shorter, easier approach to the hut via Val Bondasca, which used to be the standard route, was closed for a long time and reopened in the summer of 2026 (see separate route). The approach described here is well marked in white-blue-white; it is longer and more challenging, but well secured at exposed sections. It follows old trail marks on the western side of Val Trubinasca, where it joins the path from the Trubinasca Pass to the Sasc Furä Hut. On the descent, this route forms a possible conclusion to the Sentiero Alpino Bregaglia as the 5th stage.</p>",
